XMRT-Node CLI — Termux-Compatible Android Mining Node
=====================================================
Commands:
  xmrt-node status    — Check node health, mining stats, fleet status
  xmrt-node start     — Start the XMRig mining daemon
  xmrt-node stop      — Stop the mining daemon
  xmrt-node logs      — View recent mining logs
  xmrt-node peers     — List fleet peers from the relay mesh
  xmrt-node config    — View or modify configuration
  xmrt-node install   — Run the Termux setup/install process

Part of the XMRT-DAO fleet. Reports to relay.mobilemonero.com
"""

